    "en": "Uses your Grok sign-in and models. Install with curl -fsSL https://x.ai/cli/install.sh | bash, then run grok login once; PandaCode talks to grok agent stdio.",
    "zh-CN": "使用您的 Grok 登录和模型。运行 curl -fsSL https://x.ai/cli/install.sh | bash 安装，然后运行 grok login 登录一次；PandaCode 通过 grok agent stdio 通信。"
